{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21839","headline":"桐花落 · 元稹","name":"桐花落","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莎草徧桐阴，桐花满莎落。\n盖覆相团圆，可怜无厚薄。\n昔岁幽院中，深堂下帘幕。\n同在後门前，因论花好恶。\n君夸沈檀样，云是指撝作。\n暗澹灭紫花，句连蹙金萼。\n都绣六七枝，鬬成双孔雀。\n尾上稠叠花，又将金解络。\n我爱看不已，君烦睡先着。\n我作绣桐诗，系君帬带着。\n别来苦修道，此意都萧索。\n今日竟相牵，思量偶然错。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}